This repository holds a copy of parts of UWB-ASC 1.0.0, the UWB Anchor
Self-Calibration Dataset (https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24055896,
https://github.com/PaulSchwarzbach/UWB-ASC-dataset). The copied code keeps
UWB-ASC's MIT notice, which names the same holder and whose full text stands
in Code/datasets/radiocal/LICENSE. It covers these files:

  Code/datasets/radiocal/             the radiocal package
  Code/methods/range_errors.py        the range simulator
  Code/methods/synthetic.py
  Code/external/readers/              the readers of public range recordings
  Code/external/convert_external.py   the converter
  Code/external/session_writer.py
  Code/external/sources.yaml          the fetch list
  Code/external/README.md             with revised pointers to the tutorial

The copied measured sessions and their documentation under Data/ are
licensed under CC BY 4.0 (LICENSE-DATA). This copy leaves out UWB-ASC's
synthetic draws.
